      "releaseNotes": "Urgent Stability Update & Bug Fixes\n\nCustom Stream Fix: Resolved an issue where Custom URLs failed to play from the Favourites menu. Custom audio streams now deploy flawlessly across Favourites, Scenes, Presets, and Recents.\n\nPull-to-Refresh Calibration: Tamed the swipe-down refresh gesture. It is now much less sensitive and restricted to the top header area, preventing accidental triggers and unnecessary \"Speaker Unresponsive\" errors while navigating the app.\n\nScene & Preset Protection: Improved hardware stability by gracefully blocking unsupported Spotify Connect streams from being saved to physical Presets or multi-room Scenes, preventing network lockups during deployment.\n\nHighly recommended update for all users to ensure maximum app stability.",
